        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Omnia 11442, Clark Door Knob Mortise Lockset</b>\r\n\r\n<p>The Clark Door Knob Mortise Lockset is available in Satin Nickel, Satin Chrome, Polished Brass, Polished Chrome, and other finishes. Omnia's mortise locksets are for residential and commercial use. Built to withstand heavy use, the commercial grade, UL listed, and fire rated mortise lock combines precision engineering for security and durability with attractive design. Built to withstand heavy use, the commercial grade, UL listed, and fire rated mortise lock combines precision engineering for security and durability with attractive design.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Also available for standard pre-drilled doors: <a href=\"/products/clark-door-entry-lockset-omnia-d11442\">Omnia D11442</a></p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/MUL-T-LOCK-E08LE2_size.gif?v=1704442274\" width=\"600\" height=\"307\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Mortise Box Dimensions\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Clark Mortise Lockset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Keyway: Schlage \"C\"</li>\r\n<li>Tough, non rusting materials used throughout. </li>\r\n<li>Mortise case is heavy wrought steel with zinc dichromate finish for corrosion resistance.</li>\r\n<li>Deadbolt: Full 1\" Throw, Solid Brass with Saw-proof Insert.</li>\r\n<li>UL Listed 3 Hour</li>\r\n<li>ANSI A156.13.2005, Grade 1 Lock</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for Omnia 11442 Clark Knob Mortise Entryset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Backplate Height: 10-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Backplate Width: 2-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Knob Diameter: 2-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Doors Thickness: Optional, 1-3/4\" - 2-1/4\" Thick Doors (<a href=\"/pages/contact\">Contact Us</a> if doors are thicker)</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-1/2\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>2-1⁄2” b.s.: with 3-7⁄8” minimum stile</li>\r\n<li>2-3⁄4” b.s.: with 4-1⁄2” minimum stile</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<li>Front: Adjustable armored steel front, with 8\" x 1-1/4\" solid brass faceplate.</li>\r\n<li>Strike: Solid brass curved lip strike.4-7⁄8” x 1-1⁄4” x lip 1-1⁄4” to center.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/mortise-lockset-specs.pdf?v=1704262187\" target=\"new\"><b>Omnia Mortise Lockset Dimensions and Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Clark Door Knob Mortise Lockset",
                "description": "The Clark Door Knob Mortise Lockset is available in Satin Nickel, Satin Chrome, Polished Brass, Polished Chrome, and other finishes. Omnia's mortise locksets are for residential and commercial use. Built to withstand heavy use, the commercial grade, UL listed, and fire rated mortise lock combines precision engineering for security and durability with attractive design. The backplates feature a unique inside-to-outside mounting with screw-less outside plates.\r\n",
                "keywords": "OMN-11442 Contemporary Door Knob Mortise Locksets, Omnia 11442 Mortise Locksets, omnia deadbolt, omnia commercial mortise deadbolts, omnia #442 door knobs, omnia 442 knobs, contemporary knobs, contemporary door knobs,  Clark Mortise Locksets, Clark Door Knob Mortise Locksets, Clark Mortise Entrysets,"
